### No token - expect 401
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets

###

### USER token - expect 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

###

### POST with USER token - expect 403
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Should be blocked",
  "description": "USER role cannot create tickets",
  "category": "Network",
  "priority": "LOW",
  "createdBy": "farah@example.com"
}

###

### POST with ADMIN token - expect 201
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Should be allowed",
  "description": "ADMIN role can create tickets",
  "category": "Network",
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "createdBy": "admin@example.com"
}
